      "title": "MSYS2: Fix detection of test suite binaries",
      "message": "MSYS2: Fix detection of test suite binaries\n\nFix hack to find test binaries. We must only search in run/<config>\nif using Visual Studio.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
